---
source: crates/specforge-cli/tests/extension_surfaces.rs
expression: help
---
Per owner, the features, milestones, deliverables and releases it owns (most first, ties by owner), paged, and how many of those entities have no owner.

Usage: specforge product owner-workload [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --limit <LIMIT>
          Return at most this many (default 100, clamped to 1-1000)

      --offset <OFFSET>
          Skip this many first (default 0)

      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
